OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:Fry across the region with
OL,6,Fbright spells today. However, cloud
OL,7,Fwill thicken at times to turn the
OL,8,Fsunshine hazy. Feeling warm in the
OL,9,Fsunny spells, particularly across the
OL,10,Fsouth.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FClear skies at first. Cloud
OL,13,Fwill thicken tonight with outbreaks of
OL,14,Flight rain moving in after midnight.
OL,15,FStaying mild under the blanket of
OL,16,Fcloud with a gentle breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
