OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FStaying largely cloudy on
OL,6,FSunday with further outbreaks of rain
OL,7,Fpossible at times. The rain will be
OL,8,Fmostly light, although some heavier
OL,9,Fbursts are possible in the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,12,FTurning more unsettled in the outlook
OL,13,Fwith a spell of heavy rain on Monday.
OL,14,FScattered heavy showers and sunny
OL,15,Fspells will move in through Tuesday
OL,16,Fand Wednesday. Temperatures around
OL,17,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
